  "description": "<p>This task will involve implementing the operation from the HTTP to (but not including) the PersistentStorageSession layer.  You'll need to implement CreateRDFSourceOperationBuilder, and CreateRDFSourceOperation as well as all steps for connecting the http layer to the PersistentStorageSession.  You will need to implement for both PUT and POST.</p>",
